# Report screenshots and exported PDFs under docs/
# Generated artefacts of a management update — the source is the Markdown and
# the app itself, and these are large (the 2026-09-04 update alone is ~1.4 MB
# of JPG, PNG and PDF). The app's own images live under frontend/ and are
# tracked deliberately; this rule is scoped to docs/ so it never catches them.
docs/**/*.png
docs/**/*.jpg
docs/**/*.jpeg
docs/**/*.gif
docs/**/*.webp
docs/**/*.pdf
